OL,3,GNEWSASecond youth employment hub to
OL,4,Aopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second employment hub for 16 to 24
OL,7,Fyear-olds will open in Cambridgeshire
OL,8,Fafter the first centre celebrated
OL,9,Fsupporting 1,000 young people.
OL,11,FConservative Mayor Paul Bristow said
OL,12,Fthe centre would open in Wisbech in
OL,13,FJanuary, building on the success of the
OL,14,FPeterborough Youth Employment Hub which
OL,15,Fopened in November 2025.
OL,17,FThe centres offer mentoring and
OL,18,Fworkshops for young working age people,
OL,19,Fas well as support for mental health
OL,20,Fand housing issues.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
